ately AFTER the reference release frame10. Keep the right arm almost at full upper-left reach but bend elbow slightly to start recovery. Brush tip remains upper-left, about30degrees above horizontal. Left arm lowers scroll only a little from release, fingers securely pinch the top left part of the scroll roller/edge. Knee bend eases only a little. Keep stance width and boots nearly same as reference frame10. Ribbon still trails right.",
